      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: They can have their exclusivity and keep the avatars greyed out, I just want to throw avatars in there that I no longer use. So when you purchase VRC+ , you can access all the avatars that you neatly organized yourself.",
