  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like a feature that allows users to manage their favourite avatars without VRC+. \n\nThe only time I can sort them, is by purchasing VRC+ to organise the avatars I have saved. \n\nRight now, my 50 free slots are all used up and I would like to move them back into my VRC+ slots to just free up the clutter in the little space I do have. Users are able to move avatars from their VRC+ slots to the free space but aren't able to move them back.",
